; Prepared composed C lookup control. Codec pages, B3 hashes, pinned reads,
; adapter byte writes, harvest/handback, format verification and XL lookup
; are actual implementations. Catalog admission below is SYNTHETIC: this
; fixture does not establish selected-descriptor/root4/B-holder authority,
; bootstrap layout acceptance, or durable acceptance of the initial live facts.
; Fuel bounds only the fixture; success requires complete physical reads and
; terminal lookup, never a seeded cache row or a caller readiness flag.
(in-package "ACL2")
(include-book "../books/executor")
(include-book "../books/checkpoint-summary-apply")
(include-book "../books/checkpoint-metadata-source")
(include-book "std/util/bstar" :dir :system)

